[HEADER]
id: squall_deck
title: Blackwake In The Squall
ascii_art: ./art/storm_deck_anim.txt

[CONTENT]
Rain lashes the deck of the Blackwake while pirate songs break into shouts.
Ahead, a reef glows with cold blue fire.
Below, something vast circles the keel.

[OPTIONS]
hold_line | Hold the line and load chainshot -> ./deck/cannon.level
dive_reef | Dive for the glowing reef gate -> ./reef/gate.level

[DIRECTIVES]
input_mode: choice
ascii_art_mode: animated
